plugin nextTimeline (
    name: Next Timeline
    staticId: AMC_NEXT_TIMELINE
    type: templateComponent
    templateComponent {
        availableAs: [
            report
        ]
        partial:
            ```html
            <span class="amc-NTimeline-marker" aria-hidden="true">{if ?ICON/}<span class="amc-NTimeline-icon fa #ICON#"></span>{endif/}</span>
            {if ?DATE/}<span class="amc-NTimeline-date">#DATE#</span>{endif/}
            <div class="amc-NTimeline-card">
              <h3 class="amc-NTimeline-title">#TITLE#</h3>
              {if ?BODY/}<p class="amc-NTimeline-body">#BODY#</p>{endif/}
              <span class="amc-NTimeline-foot">{if ?TAG/}<span class="amc-NTimeline-tag">#TAG#</span>{endif/}<span class="amc-NTimeline-state">{case STATE/}{when success/}Done{when current/}In progress{when warning/}Attention{when danger/}Problem{when info/}Info{otherwise/}Pending{endcase/}</span></span>
            </div>
            ```
        reportBody:
            ```html
            <div class="amc-NTimeline amc-NTimeline--#STYLE#"><ol class="amc-NTimeline-list">#APEX$ROWS#</ol></div>
            ```
        reportRow:
            ```html
            <li class="amc-NTimeline-item amc-NTimeline-item--{case STATE/}{when success/}success{when current/}current{when warning/}warning{when danger/}danger{when info/}info{otherwise/}neutral{endcase/}{if ?TAG/} amc-NTimeline-item--tagged{endif/}"{case STATE/}{when current/} aria-current="step"{endcase/}{case STYLE/}{when expandSteps/} tabindex="0"{endcase/}>#APEX$PARTIAL#</li>
            ```
        translateTemplates: true
        defaultEscapeMode: html
    }
    advanced {
        filePrefix: #PLUGIN_FILES#
        quickPick: false
        substituteAttributeValues: true
        deprecated: false
        legacy: false
    }
    css {
        fileUrls: [
            #PLUGIN_FILES#amc-next-timeline.css
        ]
    }
    information {
        version: 1.0.1
        helpText:
            ```
            Each query row is one event, in the order the query returns them. Pick a Style for the whole region, then map Title (required), Body, Date, Icon, State and Tag to columns. Format dates in SQL with the application's NLS settings. State accepts success, current, warning, danger, info or neutral; any other value renders as neutral. For progress journeys return success for done steps, current for the active step and neutral for steps not reached yet. Pure CSS, no JavaScript.
            ```
    }
    customAttribute STYLE (
        apexlangName: style
        attribute: 1
        name: Style
        scope: component
        type: selectList
        appearance {
            sequence: 10
        }
        componentLov {
            type: static
        }
        validation {
            required: true
        }
        security {
            escapeMode: htmlAttribute
        }
        default {
            value: beamRail
        }
        help {
            helpText:
                ```
                Design of the timeline; the direction is given in brackets as motion, depth, bold or smart. beamRail [motion]: a light pulse travels down the rail and a border beam circles the current event. pulseNow [motion]: done steps glow, the current step pulses, later steps wait on a dashed rail. perspectiveRoad [depth]: events line a road that recedes in perspective and flattens on hover or focus; order the query so the nearest event comes last. stackedCards3d [depth]: tilted cards cascade in depth and come forward on hover or focus. neoBrutal [bold]: ink rail, diamond markers, hard shadows and date stickers. clay [bold]: a clay groove with soft clay markers and cards. kineticYears [bold]: oversized outlined dates carry the structure and fill on hover or focus; return short dates such as 2026 or Q3. metroLine [bold]: a transit-map line with stations, horizontal in wide regions and vertical when narrow; a Tag turns a station into an interchange. scrollProgress [smart]: the rail fills and the markers light up as the list scrolls through the page; a static fill where scroll-driven animation is not supported. expandSteps [smart]: step panels that expand on hover, focus or tap to show the Body, side by side in wide regions and stacked when narrow; the current step is open at rest.
                ```
        }
        entry beamRail (
            sequence: 10
            display: Beam rail
            return: beamRail
        )
        entry pulseNow (
            sequence: 20
            display: Pulse now
            return: pulseNow
        )
        entry perspectiveRoad (
            sequence: 30
            display: Perspective road
            return: perspectiveRoad
        )
        entry stackedCards3d (
            sequence: 40
            display: Stacked cards 3D
            return: stackedCards3d
        )
        entry neoBrutal (
            sequence: 50
            display: Neo-brutal
            return: neoBrutal
        )
        entry clay (
            sequence: 60
            display: Clay
            return: clay
        )
        entry kineticYears (
            sequence: 70
            display: Kinetic years
            return: kineticYears
        )
        entry metroLine (
            sequence: 80
            display: Metro line
            return: metroLine
        )
        entry scrollProgress (
            sequence: 90
            display: Scroll progress
            return: scrollProgress
        )
        entry expandSteps (
            sequence: 100
            display: Expand steps
            return: expandSteps
        )
    )
    customAttribute TITLE (
        apexlangName: title
        attribute: 2
        name: Title
        scope: component
        type: sessionStateValue
        appearance {
            sequence: 20
        }
        validation {
            required: true
        }
        security {
            escapeMode: html
        }
        help {
            helpText:
                ```
                Event or step heading, for example Contract signed or Pilot in 3 stores.
                ```
        }
    )
    customAttribute BODY (
        apexlangName: body
        attribute: 3
        name: Body
        scope: component
        type: sessionStateValue
        appearance {
            sequence: 30
        }
        validation {
            required: false
        }
        security {
            escapeMode: html
        }
        help {
            helpText:
                ```
                Optional description. In Expand steps it is shown when a step is opened; in Metro line keep it short.
                ```
        }
    )
    customAttribute DATE (
        apexlangName: date
        attribute: 4
        name: Date
        scope: component
        type: sessionStateValue
        appearance {
            sequence: 40
        }
        validation {
            required: false
        }
        security {
            escapeMode: html
        }
        help {
            helpText:
                ```
                Date or time text, already formatted in SQL, for example 12 Sep 2026. Kinetic years shows it very large, so return a short value such as 2026, Q3 or Mar.
                ```
        }
    )
    customAttribute ICON (
        apexlangName: icon
        attribute: 5
        name: Icon
        scope: component
        type: sessionStateValue
        appearance {
            sequence: 50
        }
        validation {
            required: false
        }
        security {
            escapeMode: htmlAttribute
        }
        help {
            helpText:
                ```
                Font APEX icon class shown inside the marker by the styles with large markers, for example fa-check or fa-truck.
                ```
        }
    )
    customAttribute STATE (
        apexlangName: state
        attribute: 6
        name: State
        scope: component
        type: sessionStateValue
        appearance {
            sequence: 60
        }
        validation {
            required: false
        }
        security {
            escapeMode: htmlAttribute
        }
        help {
            helpText:
                ```
                One of success, current, warning, danger, info or neutral. Colors the marker and rail and is always given as text too. current marks the active step: it pulses, gets aria-current and is open at rest in Expand steps. neutral means not reached yet in the progress styles. Unknown values render as neutral.
                ```
        }
    )
    customAttribute TAG (
        apexlangName: tag
        attribute: 7
        name: Tag
        scope: component
        type: sessionStateValue
        appearance {
            sequence: 70
        }
        validation {
            required: false
        }
        security {
            escapeMode: html
        }
        help {
            helpText:
                ```
                Short label shown as a chip, for example a version v2.4, a team or a line code. In Metro line it marks the station as an interchange with that code.
                ```
        }
    )
    file "amc-next-timeline.css" (
        fileName: amc-next-timeline.css
        mimeType: text/css
        charSet: utf-8
    )
)
